# This folder is my main working folder: a full copy of tau2-bench (Sierra Research)
# plus my own work. Only my own work goes to GitHub, so this file is a WHITELIST:
# ignore everything at the top level, then allow only my folders and files.
# A new top-level file or folder of mine must be added below with a "!" line.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/fde_agent/
!/trace_viewer/
!/runs/
!/benchmark-changes/

# Never pushed, even inside my folders
.venv/
__pycache__/
.cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
trace_viewer/backups/
.env
